  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 304.05 Failure to Comply. Failure to provide any of the information required under Ncr 304.02 shall result in denial of a petition unless corrections are made within 10 days of notification by the natural heritage bureau of any missing information.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ncr 300) #12980, eff 1-24-20",
